00:28:39,120 --> 00:28:39,960
Now,

591
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:41,480
let me announce

592
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:43,210
the casting for the main roles.

593
00:28:44,520 --> 00:28:45,920
The role of Lao Lao goes to

594
00:28:47,160 --> 00:28:47,960
Big Cousin.

595
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,760
The role of Yan Chixia goes to

596
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:54,340
Jiao Ye.

597
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,960
The role of Black Mountain Demon goes to

598
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:01,720
Qingsong.

599
00:29:08,360 --> 00:29:09,290
The female lead,

600
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:11,330
the role of Nie Xiaoqian...

601
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:12,760
Me.

602
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:16,840
That's right.

603
00:29:17,520 --> 00:29:19,520
It's still our familiar Bai Feixin.

604
00:29:22,000 --> 00:29:24,200
The male lead, the role of Ning Caichen,

605
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:27,980
is naturally played by our excellent...

606
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:29,400
Jin Xi.

607
00:29:30,520 --> 00:29:32,000
I'm sorry for not notifying everyone earlier.

608
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,840
Now,

609
00:29:33,040 --> 00:29:35,920
I'd like to officially give you all a little surprise.

610
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:37,960
Today, I officially announce

611
00:29:38,520 --> 00:29:40,080
that our Xiyin Theater Troupe

612
00:29:40,080 --> 00:29:42,520
will sign singer Jin Xi

613
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:43,520
to be

614
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:46,160
the undisputed male lead of "A Chinese Ghost Story",

615
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,960
Ning Caichen.

616
00:29:48,840 --> 00:29:50,760
I believe that with Jin Xi joining us,

617
00:29:50,760 --> 00:29:52,920
our theater troupe and this play

618
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:55,520
will definitely have a huge impact.

619
00:29:55,920 --> 00:29:56,760
Here,

620
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:58,240
Director Ning,

621
00:29:58,240 --> 00:30:00,880
and everyone else, please help

622
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:02,120
Jin Xi.

623
00:30:02,280 --> 00:30:04,720
Let's make this play a success together.

624
00:30:07,040 --> 00:30:08,900
Hello everyone, my name is Jin Xi.

625
00:30:09,080 --> 00:30:10,210
Nice to meet you all.

626
00:30:10,760 --> 00:30:13,200
I really look forward to joining this family.

627
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:13,840
Thank you.

628
00:30:15,120 --> 00:30:16,960
Great.
